<Positioned left="118" top="112"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0B1B33" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">TOOL NEST</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="118" top="136"><Text fontSize="18" color="#6E6A5E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">叠光共享工具房</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="216"><Text fontSize="60" color="#2A2A35" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">第一次来，不会用？</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="310"><Text fontSize="28" color="#2A2A35" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">这在工具房很正常。按这三张牌做完就行：</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="400" width="960" height="250"><Container width="960" height="250" color="#FAF5EA" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="400" width="10" height="250"><Container width="10" height="250" color="#FFC154" borderRadius="12" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="110" top="436"><Text fontSize="40" color="#2A2A35" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">① 看看牌子</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="110" top="512" width="840"><Text fontSize="26" color="#3D3C46" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">每台工具右上都有一块编号牌，编号与预约页、看板一致。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="680" width="960" height="250"><Container width="960" height="250" color="#EFE5CE" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="680" width="10" height="250"><Container width="10" height="250" color="#FFC154" borderRadius="12" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="110" top="716"><Text fontSize="40" color="#2A2A35" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">② 举手找人</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="110" top="792" width="840"><Text fontSize="26" color="#3D3C46" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">服务台总有志愿者：上午李工 · 下午赵姐 · 晚间小陈；离岗时会挂“暂停服务”牌。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="960" width="960" height="250"><Container width="960" height="250" color="#FAF5EA" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="960" width="10" height="250"><Container width="10" height="250" color="#FFC154" borderRadius="12" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="110" top="996"><Text fontSize="40" color="#2A2A35" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">③ 先读红色</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="110" top="1072" width="840"><Text fontSize="26" color="#3D3C46" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">开关上的红色牌是安全提示与急停位置，先读再动手。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1240" width="960" height="190"><Container width="960" height="190" color="#2A2A35" borderRadius="12" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="100" top="1266"><Text fontSize="30" color="#FFC154" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">联系与报备（演示信息）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="100" top="1318"><Text fontSize="28" color="#FAF5EA" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">服务台电话 0755-XXXX-XXXX（以值班表为准）</Text></Positioned>
